{#
  Crew cutout (two technicians; replaced the single-tech photo 2026-10-21) anchored to the bottom-right of a hero band, directly
  under the main menu. Eye contact next to the phone/CTA lifts conversions.
  Decorative (empty alt) so screen readers skip it.

  Switch: site.heroTech.enabled (src/_data/site.json). Per-page opt-out:
  heroTech: false in front matter. Shown from the `min` breakpoint up
  (site.heroTech.min = "lg" or "xl"); phones/tablets never load it.
  Source files (TSR crew photo, renamed per site): src/assets/img/all_sewer_plumbing_services_technicians-{320,480,640}.webp
  Must be included INSIDE a `relative` wrapper: the hero's `container-x relative`
  div (inner pages: he stands at its bottom-right) or, on the home page, the
  county-dispatch card wrapper with techClass overriding his position. Tailwind safelist (keep): lg:block xl:block
#}
{% set techMin = min or site.heroTech.min or "lg" %}
{% set techPos = techClass or "bottom-0 right-0" %}
{% if site.heroTech.enabled and heroTech != false %}
<img
  src="/assets/img/all_sewer_plumbing_services_technicians-480.webp"
  srcset="/assets/img/all_sewer_plumbing_services_technicians-320.webp 320w, /assets/img/all_sewer_plumbing_services_technicians-480.webp 480w, /assets/img/all_sewer_plumbing_services_technicians-640.webp 640w"
  sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 320px, 256px"
  alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="640" height="709"
  loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"
  class="pointer-events-none absolute {{ techPos }} z-0 hidden w-64 select-none drop-shadow-[0_12px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)] {{ techMin }}:block xl:w-80">
{% endif %}
